---
const points = [
  'In-house design, construction and finishing — no subcontracted guesswork',
  'Villa gardens and landscaping planned around the pool, not as an afterthought',
  'Scheduled maintenance and water treatment plans for existing pools',
  'Diagnosis and repair of leaks, pumps, tiling and old liners',
  'Custom fencing and safety barriers for pools with young children or pets',
];
---
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2>Pools by Loftmax</h2>
      <p class="about-lead">A Dubai-based team that designs, builds and looks after swimming pools for villas and private homes.</p>
      <p>We started Pools by Loftmax because too many pool projects in this city are handed off between a designer, a contractor and a maintenance crew who never talk to each other — and the pool suffers for it. We keep design, build and aftercare under one roof, so the person who drew your pool is accountable for how it actually performs.</p>
      <blockquote>&ldquo;A pool has to work in July, not just look good in the render. That's the standard we hold every project to.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <p class="signature">Founder &amp; Managing Director</p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        {points.map((point) => (
          <li>
            <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke-width="1.6"/>
              <path d="M7.5 12.5 L10.5 15.5 L16.5 9"/>
            </svg>
            {point}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-image" style="background-image:url('/images/gallery/project-9.jpeg')"></div>
  </div>
</section>
